   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Barriers to Trade (TBT) Mentorship Prog</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kommerskollegium st&#xf6;der utvalda Afrikanska regeringar implementera    och p&#xe5;verka V&#xe4;rldshandelsorganisationens (WTOs) avtal om tekniska     handelshinder (TBT) (vilket f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;krar att tekniska regler inte utg&#xf6;r  on&#xf6;diga handelshinder).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish National Board of Trade Mentorship Program assists        selected African governments implement and influence the World Trade  Organization&apos;s Technical Barriers to Trade (TBT) Agreement (which     ensures that technical rules do not create unnecessary obstacles to   trade).</narrative>
  </description>
